# cards: the basic version (docs/plan-cards.md 3). Lucia wears Quetzalcoatl (paired with Jian's Weapon Break, so
# hers is the basic: ATK down on one picked enemy) at 2000 points. Round 1: Jian Fights; Lucia's card entry opens
# the enemy grid (shot cb_grid); A on the highlighted enemy uses the card on it alone: only that enemy's ATK stage
# goes to -1 (watches stage_*), points 2000 -> 1900. Round 2, every enemy's ATK set one stage down first: the
# pick is refused ("No effect!", shot cb_refused), the grid stays up, and the points stay 1900.
include party2_strong
poke u8 0x0213BA1B 1
poke u16 0x020B48AC 2000
poke u16 0x020B46FE 236
pin u32 0x0228ea24 500
pin u32 0x0228ea90 500
pin u32 0x0228eafc 500
pin u32 0x0228ebd4 500
pin u32 0x0228ec40 500
pin u32 0x0228ecac 500
wait 270
watch u16 0x0228EA50 stage_0
watch u16 0x0228EABC stage_1
watch u16 0x0228EB28 stage_2
watch u16 0x0228EB94 stage_3
watch u16 0x0228EC00 stage_4
watch u16 0x0228EC6C stage_5
watch u16 0x0228ECD8 stage_6
watch u16 0x020B48AC points
press A 8
wait 50
press A 8
wait 60
press A 8
wait 60
press Right 8
wait 50
press A 8
wait 60
press Down 8
wait 30
shot cb_pick
press A 8
wait 60
shot cb_grid
press A 8
wait 40
shot cb_after
wait 1500
shot cb_r2_start
poke u16 0x0228EA50 65535
poke u16 0x0228EABC 65535
poke u16 0x0228EB28 65535
poke u16 0x0228EB94 65535
poke u16 0x0228EC00 65535
poke u16 0x0228EC6C 65535
poke u16 0x0228ECD8 65535
press A 8
wait 60
press A 8
wait 60
press Right 8
wait 50
press A 8
wait 60
press Down 8
wait 30
press A 8
wait 60
shot cb_r2_grid
press A 8
wait 20
shot cb_refused
wait 60
shot cb_refused2
